{"version":"1","id":"slidebean","handle":"slidebean","name":"Slidebean","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/s--ZuWWFJQ6--/f_auto/v1761722215/logos/slidebean","description":null,"is_squad":false,"x":-1.1469,"y":-5.7746,"cluster_id":3,"posts_collected":208,"newest_post_at":"2026-05-07T19:58:40.000Z","oldest_post_at":"2025-09-22T16:11:31.000Z","features":{"hype_score":0.004808,"listicle_ratio":0.004808,"question_ratio":0.0,"avg_read_time":2.682692,"summary_length_avg":490.417647,"title_length_avg":60.134615,"title_length_var":302.568417,"tag_entropy":4.129496,"tag_diversity":0.572115,"top_tag_share":0.322115,"avg_upvotes":0.120192,"median_upvotes":0.0,"avg_comments":0.014423,"comment_to_upvote_ratio":0.153846,"zero_engagement_share":0.894231,"viral_share":0.0,"posts_per_week":7.641442,"non_article_ratio":1.0,"author_present_share":0.0,"recency_skew":0.475177},"view_coords":{"engagement_style":[-8.0441,-4.6618],"cadence_depth":[3.1765,-6.8382],"hype_variety":[-1.6765,7.9559],"title_style":[-5.0441,1.0882]},"top_tags":[["ai",68],["machine-learning",24],["openai",20],["privacy",14],["ethics",13],["startup",13],["llm",12],["hardware",12]],"sample_titles":{"representative":["Lawyers fined for submitting AI-hallucinated fake court cases","Anthropic source code leak exposed Claude Code architecture and unreleased features","Visa and Mastercard position stablecoins at the center of global payments"],"outlier":["AI Agent"]},"recent_posts":[{"id":"afri8Uo7r","title":"Samsung exits China TV and home appliance market as domestic brands take over","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KdWGXC3DINU","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/why-samsung-just-surrendered-china-afri8uo7r","summary":"Samsung has officially announced it will stop selling TVs and home appliances in mainland China, marking a significant retreat from one of the world's largest consumer electronics markets. The decision comes after years of mounting losses as domestic Chinese brands like TCL have outpaced foreign competitors through aggressive localized pricing and faster innovation cycles. Samsung will continue selling smartphones and medical equipment in China, but its hardware dominance in the living room segment is over. This signals a broader warning for Western and Korean tech giants: the strategy of exporting premium hardware to China no longer works as domestic competition has become genuinely world-class, not just cheap.","image":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/KdWGXC3DINU/sddefault.jpg","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2026-05-07T19:58:40.000Z"},{"id":"JB4WO58lv","title":"Apple secretly negotiates with Samsung and Intel to reduce TSMC dependence","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xTPWFpfQHpw","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/apple-is-secretly-trying-to-escape-tsmc-jb4wo58lv","summary":"Apple is reportedly in secret negotiations with Samsung and Intel to reduce its total dependence on TSMC for chip manufacturing. Currently, TSMC is the sole foundry capable of producing the 3nm silicon Apple requires, creating a significant supply chain vulnerability tied to Taiwan. Apple's goal is not cost reduction but diversification \u2014 building an alternative supply route to regain control over its hardware future.","image":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/xTPWFpfQHpw/sddefault.jpg","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2026-05-07T18:44:43.000Z"},{"id":"f9KxktYjq","title":"Google DeepMind workers in the UK vote to unionize over military AI contracts","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1MYlxv1KAQI","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/the-secret-mutiny-inside-google-deepmind-f9kxktyjq","summary":"Google DeepMind workers in the UK have voted to unionize in response to a secret contract between Google and the US military. Engineers who have long opposed using their AI in weapons systems are alarmed by management quietly pursuing defense contracts. The dispute centers on workers demanding a say in how their code is deployed, while Google risks losing key AI talent amid an intensifying AI arms race.","image":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/1MYlxv1KAQI/sddefault.jpg","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2026-05-06T21:52:32.000Z"},{"id":"BtqPwIOJh","title":"The Roomba creator is building an AI pet","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wZhGVVb-1Ok","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/the-roomba-creator-is-building-an-ai-pet-btqpwiojh","summary":"Colin Angle, founder of iRobot and inventor of the Roomba, has launched a new venture called Familiar Machines. Their first product is a four-legged AI companion robot resembling a small bear-dog hybrid. It features 23 degrees of freedom, a touch-sensitive coat, and uses on-device generative AI to learn user habits and respond emotionally \u2014 all without internet connectivity. Unlike traditional home robots focused on utility, this device is designed purely for companionship, positioning the next era of robotics around addressing loneliness rather than performing chores.","image":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/wZhGVVb-1Ok/sddefault.jpg","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2026-05-06T20:02:31.000Z"},{"id":"vu5XWRZSO","title":"How this old camera saved Fujifilm from bankruptcy","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Bgl1bsrXgXg","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/how-this-old-camera-saved-fujifilm-from-bankruptcy-vu5xwrzso","summary":null,"image":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Bgl1bsrXgXg/sddefault.jpg","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2026-05-04T16:25:48.000Z"},{"id":"lmTV3OZI2","title":"The Credit Card Trap","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=m9tCC31Sd9k","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/the-credit-card-trap-lmtv3ozi2","summary":null,"image":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/m9tCC31Sd9k/sddefault.jpg","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2026-05-01T17:22:21.000Z"},{"id":"O9fylRJlw","title":"Why 3D Printers Never Took Off","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7xjNO9sD